{"id":"n83169-1-24","stage":2,"title":"변화 · 变化","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83169-1-24-1","ko":"김 대리는 기쁠 때나 슬플 때나 항상 저 표정이야.","zh":"金代理不管高兴还是难过，总是那个表情。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）。","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"대리는","meaning":"代理","explanation":"대리：代理；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"대리","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48362","senseId":"2","lemma":"대리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대리는","audio":"/audio/42850fb56df91045e6e7.mp3"}},{"text":"기쁠","meaning":"高兴，开心","explanation":"기쁘다：高兴，开心；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"기쁘다","audio":"/audio/34ce48b9a78ae52e1c3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40078","senseId":"1","lemma":"기쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기쁠","audio":"/audio/dfdb64cc25f1f8f49251.mp3"}},{"text":"때나","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候；나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때나","audio":"/audio/e8fbdee8a3255734de29.mp3"}},{"text":"슬플","meaning":"悲伤的，伤心的","explanation":"슬프다：悲伤的，伤心的；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"슬프다","audio":"/audio/710c55f6dfa550624362.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65103","senseId":"1","lemma":"슬프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"슬플","audio":"/audio/def26a6fea97de2b6823.mp3"}},{"text":"때나","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceR